                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "During National Cancer Prevention and Early Detection Month, we\u2019re reminded that early detection is the key to drastically improving quality of life for American cancer patients and their families while saving taxpayer dollars by treating cancer before it spreads.\n\nProud to lead the Medicare Multi-Cancer Early Detection Screening Coverage Act with @RepTerriSewell @RepRichHudson @RepRaulRuizMD to ensure this game-changing medical innovation is available to our nation\u2019s seniors.",
