                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill locks in President Trump\u2019s America First agenda and delivers for Rural America:\n\u00a0\n\u2705 Lowers taxes\u00a0\n\u2705 Reins-in spending\u00a0\n\u2705 Secures the border\n\u2705 Strengthens ag safety net\u00a0\n\u2705 $B\u2019s for rural hospitals\n\u00a0\nI\u2019m proud to have delivered real wins for West Texans and all of America! \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
